\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Remark}
\title{How we separate feedback from credit}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{feedback}
\tag{credit-assignment}

\p{We synthesize the two interfaces from terminal returns, process labels,
preference observations, and verifier rewards introduced earlier. Those
sources determine what information is observed. A credit rule determines
where that information enters an objective. No cited method defines the full
cross-method interface.}

\p{Separating the interfaces permits questions about delayed, noisy, or
misallocated credit without changing the underlying evidence.}
